comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-13T01:23:33.814Z","harness:codex","Duplicate-check evidence: searched all statuses for 'telemetry timeout proxy flush fetch failed' and 'telemetry HTTP timeout reliability'; fully read pm-sgmb, pm-1lgy, and parent pm-lnq3. pm-sgmb is correctly closed for the earlier 2.5s-to-5s fix; this is a new observed regression with distinct configurable/background reliability scope."
  "2026-08-13T01:47:15.898Z","harness:codex","TDD evidence: the new focused test first failed because resolveTelemetryHttpTimeoutMs did not exist. Implementation then exposed Node built-in fetch's independent 10-second connect timeout on the real endpoint. Replaced worker POSTs with node:http/node:https so one bounded AbortSignal covers DNS, family selection, connect, TLS, and response; added Content-Length to avoid chunked-body edge failures. Focused runtime+docs suite passes 6/6."
  "2026-08-13T01:47:16.372Z","harness:codex","Live acceptance evidence: preserved queue flush progressed from 257 to 241 entries, drained 16, recorded last_successful_flush_at=2026-08-13T01:45:27.051Z, and cleared failed-flush fields. A second immediate receipt correctly reported no due entries while retaining the retry-backed queue; no runtime evidence was deleted."
  "2026-08-13T02:26:00.245Z","harness:codex","Final repository verification: 489 files / 7,240 tests pass; exact coverage statements 52,502/52,502, branches 38,556/38,556, functions 10,798/10,798, lines 50,727/50,727. pnpm lint, pnpm quality:static, pnpm typecheck, package artifact gate (1,392 files), native tracker/graph/record assurance, changelog check, and live queue progress all pass."
  "2026-08-13T03:25:08.032Z","harness:codex","Review follow-up evidence: a replaced fetch adapter that ignores AbortSignal is now bounded by a local deadline race; timeout aborts the supplied signal, rejects with telemetry_http_timeout, and always clears the timer. Focused 19/19 and full 7,243/7,243 tests pass at exact 100/100/100/100 coverage. pnpm typecheck, pnpm lint/static, packed-artifact gate (1,392 files), and temporary package-first dogfood (88 commands) pass."
files[2]{path,scope,note}:
  src/core/telemetry/runtime.ts,project,Bounded background HTTP timeout contract
